    "title": "Music Player - MP3 & Equalizer",
    "description": "<b>Music Player - Audio Player & MP3 Player with powerful equalizer, all formats supported and stylish UI, Music player scans all music automatically and group them by title, artist, album. </b>Easy to find the song you want. Music Player provides the best musical experience for you. Music Player - Audio Player is\u00a0the best music player for Android. \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udf88\r\n<b>Music player, mp3 player find all song formats quickly. </b>This mp3 player built-in top quality equalizer, with bass boost, reverb effects, these powerful features will takes your music listening experience to next level. \r\n\r\nMusic Player supports all music and audio formats including MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, APE, etc. And play them in high quality.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>\u00a0Powerful Beats Equalizer and Bass Booster</b>\r\n- MP3 Music Player\u00a0has Powerful Equalizer and Bass Boost. \r\n- Boost your music experience with 20+ amazing presets, 5 bands, bass booster, music virtualizer & 3D reverb effects adjustments and much more. \r\nIt's a\u00a0Powerful Music Player\u00a0and best\u00a0MP3 Player for Android\u00a0phone.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Fashion Design - Gorgeous Music Themes</b>\r\n- Crafted with Intuitive controls and Stunning Design, this MP3 Player comes in multiple stunning themes\r\n- Build-in gorgeous free background skins. Replaceable background picture.\u00a0Choose your own picture from gallery. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Built-in MP3 cutter - Ringtone Maker</b>\r\nEasily cut the best part of the audio songs and save it as Ringtone/Alarm/Notification/Music file etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 <b>Key Features for Free Music Player & Mp3 Player</b>\r\n\u2022 Browse and play your music by\u00a0Albums, Artists, Playlists, Genres, Folders etc\r\n\u2022 Support playing various audio formats such as MP3, WMA, AAC, FLAC.\r\n\u2022 Offline music player, song player, audio player, powerful mp3 player with high quality.\r\n\u2022 Smart Auto Playlists -\u00a0Favorite\u00a0list/Recently played/History\u00a0Fully playlist support\r\n\u2022 Locate and manage all music files from your phone memory and SD card.\r\n\u2022 Free to Sort and create your own customized music playlist.\r\n\u2022 Folder support\u00a0- Play song by folder\r\n\u2022 Quick search - Search for your music and video files quickly\r\n\u2022 Playing queue with reorder\u00a0- Easily add tracks & drag up/down to sort\r\n\u2022 Music player with\u00a0Lyrics Support(embedded lyrics)\r\n\u2022 Headset/Bluetooth support\r\n\u2022 Driving Mode\r\n\u2022 Tag editor support\r\n\u2022 Stylish\u00a0Widgets Support\u00a0(4x4,4x2,4x1)\r\n\u2022 Music\u00a0Duration Filter\r\n\u2022 Sleep Mode \u2013 Set timer to stop audio and video automatically\r\n\u2022 Screenshot \u2013 Take screenshot from video\r\n\u2022 Hardware acceleration.\r\n\u2022 Ultra HD video player, support 4K.\r\n\u2022 Child/Screen Lock - A very important feature for any video player\r\n\u2022 Video to audio converter\r\n\u2022 Lock your private video files. Keep your video safe with\u00a0private folder.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb7<b>Music Player\u00a0is one of the most accepted Music Player and MP3 player for android device. </b>\r\nThis whole new music player is an all in one media player. You can use it as a free mp3 player or avi player, and allows to browse folders directly. Act smartly by using this Mp3 Player - Music Player & Media Player and save your device storage. Music Player is sure to become your default audio player and mp3 player. \ud83c\udf8a\ud83c\udf89",
